64308818Z', 'done': True, 'done_reason': 'stop', 'total_duration': 11592772971, 'load_duration': 51125991, 'prompt_eval_count': 594, 'prompt_eval_duration': 376063082, 'eval_count': 491, 'eval_duration': 11164381289, 'model_name': 'phi4:14b'} id='run--13fde165-5877-426a-bd3d-b0abf5b25c50-0' usage_metadata={'input_tokens': 594, 'output_tokens': 491, 'total_tokens': 1085}
